 "description": "The new BENETEAU First 30 is a celebration of performance, comfort, and innovation—a perfect fit for the next generation of sailors. She delivers the sensation of planing, easy handling, safety and cruising comfort – a unique combination of qualities befitting the modern successor to the legendary 1977 First 30.\nWelcome to a groundbreaking new category of sailboats: the planing cruisers!\nInnovation and research : BENETEAU & Seascape",
