  {
   "kind": "slider-design-pleasure",
   "id": "anchor_main-points",
   "title": "Why First 30?",
   "intro": "",
   "items": [
    {
     "title": "Effortless joy of planing for everyone!",
     "text": "With its broad expertise and heritage, BENETEAU is launching a new category of sailboats – the planing cruiser. It redefines small-boat sailing by combining outstanding performance with unparalleled ease of use while offering the comfort of a fully equipped cruiser."
    },
    {
     "title": "For sailors like YOU",
     "text": "Combining a modern racing hull, lightness, carefully selected deck equipment, and generously sized winches makes her easy to handle for all crew members, regardless of their physical strength. The all-new First 30 brings the thrill of planing to a wide range of experienced sailors while also inspiring new endeavours in the sailing lifestyle."
    },
    {
     "title": "Planing is FUN",
     "text": "Experience the fun of fast planing, a sensation so far reserved for professional sailors, windsurfers and planing power boats. But the First 30 makes it a joyful ride every day with at least medium wind strength. You will enjoy effortlessly gliding on the top of the water, whether on a cruising trip with your family or racing with your team."
    },
    {
     "title": "A new style of COSY",
     "text": "Below deck, the innovative reinvention of all essential cruising features blends with simplicity to ensure a cosy and comfortable stay onboard. On deck, the spacious cockpit is available in two configurations: a clean, uncluttered, and comfortable chill-out area for cruising and an ergonomic, practical setup for racing."
    },
    {
     "title": "Fast is SAFE",
     "text": "Going fast is only fun if you feel safe and in control. First 30 offers exceptional stability and safety thanks to its modern design, solid construction, and twin rudders. As a result, she’s incredibly easy to handle, ensuring you always remain in control. Despite being only 30 feet, her ocean-grade Class A certification underscores her safety and seaworthiness."
    }
   ],
